Interactive Design-to-Mask (D2M) and Mask Data Preparation engineering skills portfolio, competency tracker and career development dashboard.


D2M Engineering Skills Dashboard

An interactive skills and competency dashboard for Design-to-Mask (D2M), Mask Data Preparation (MDP), OPC, computational lithography and semiconductor manufacturing engineering.

Overview

This project provides a structured framework for tracking technical competencies, engineering tools, manufacturing workflows and professional development.

Technical Domains
Design Database & Layout Integration
Mask Data Preparation & Fracturing
DFM, DRC, MRC & Verification
OPC & Computational Lithography
Mask Manufacturing & Metrology
EDA Software & Platforms
Programming & Automation
Tape-out & Engineering Operations
Advanced Mask Technologies
HPC, Data Infrastructure & Analytics
Features
Interactive technical skills matrix
Individual skill proficiency ratings
EDA tools competency tracking
Design-to-Mask workflow visualization
Career development roadmap
Engineering project documentation
JSON backup and restore
Technology Stack
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript
JSON configuration
Local Installation

Clone the repository:

bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/d2m-skills-dashboard.git


Open the project directory and run:

bash
python -m http.server 8000


Visit http://localhost:8000.

Customization

Edit skills.js to add, remove or modify technical domains, competencies, EDA tools and workflow stages.

No changes to the dashboard's HTML are required for normal skill-library updates.

Deployment

Hosted using GitHub Pages.

Disclaimer

This is an independent engineering competency and professional development project. It is not an official assessment or endorsement by any semiconductor foundry or EDA vendor.
